{
 "cut": "full",
 "dur": 56,
 "lines": [
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 0.25,
   "t1": 3,
   "text": "I donated last week… no idea what it actually did."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 3.2,
   "t1": 5.65,
   "text": "Honestly? Most donors can't easily find out."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 6.15,
   "t1": 7.25,
   "text": "Because of scams?"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 7.45,
   "t1": 8.45,
   "text": "Rarely, actually."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 8.55,
   "t1": 11.05,
   "text": "GoFundMe says *under 1 in 1,000* campaigns are fraud."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 11.25,
   "t1": 12.85,
   "text": "But the fakes are convincing."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 13.05,
   "t1": 14.85,
   "text": "One made-up story raised *$400,000*…"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 14.95,
   "t1": 17.15,
   "text": "…and paid for a *BMW* and *casino trips*."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 17.35,
   "t1": 17.85,
   "text": "Oof."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 18.65,
   "t1": 19.95,
   "text": "Then what's the problem?"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 20.15,
   "t1": 20.95,
   "text": "Not knowing."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 21.05,
   "t1": 23.2,
   "text": "Cash is easy to give, *hard to follow*."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 23.5,
   "t1": 25.3,
   "text": "So I'm just hoping for the best?"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 25.5,
   "t1": 26.3,
   "text": "Pretty much."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 27.1,
   "t1": 30.4,
   "text": "I don't need a thank-you. I just want to know it helped."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 30.65,
   "t1": 31.85,
   "text": "Maybe that's why"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 31.95,
   "t1": 34.7,
   "text": "*fewer than 1 in 5* first-time donors come back."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 35.6,
   "t1": 37.55,
   "text": "So what does CouponDonation do differently?"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 37.75,
   "t1": 40.45,
   "text": "Your donation becomes *gift cards for essentials*, not cash."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 40.6,
   "t1": 42.75,
   "text": "You get a *receipt for every gift*."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 43.35,
   "t1": 45.2,
   "text": "So it can't end up at a casino?"
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 45.4,
   "t1": 47.6,
   "text": "A grocery gift card can't buy a *BMW*."
  },
  {
   "who": "you",
   "t0": 49,
   "t1": 50.65,
   "text": "So I don't have to hope."
  },
  {
   "who": "coupon",
   "t0": 50.95,
   "t1": 51.85,
   "text": "You'll know."
  }
 ],
